@AegisDB.Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5140

### Local cluster overview (enable with Raft__Enabled=true)
GET {{AegisDB.Server_HostAddress}}/admin/cluster

### All locally hosted nodes
GET {{AegisDB.Server_HostAddress}}/admin/nodes

### One real Raft node
GET {{AegisDB.Server_HostAddress}}/admin/nodes/node-1

### Unknown node returns 404 Problem Details
GET {{AegisDB.Server_HostAddress}}/admin/nodes/unknown

### Distributed PUT (Development/Testing, loopback, enabled local Raft cluster)
PUT {{AegisDB.Server_HostAddress}}/admin/kv/user:1
Content-Type: application/json

{"value":"{\"name\":\"Alice\"}"}

### Leader-local applied read (not linearizable)
GET {{AegisDB.Server_HostAddress}}/admin/kv/user:1

### Distributed DELETE (waits for quorum commitment and application)
DELETE {{AegisDB.Server_HostAddress}}/admin/kv/user:1
